0092:     """
0093:     Slide closed foreground objects upward and open foreground objects downward, keeping their columns and stacking on collision.
0094: 
0095:     Input structure
0096:     - The grid has a single background color and several monochromatic 4-connected foreground objects.
0097:     - Some objects are closed frames with at least one enclosed background hole inside their bounding box.
0098:     - The remaining objects are open line-like sprites with no enclosed hole.
